Mathieu,

Thank you for commenting on your student proposals.   I appreciate your
cooperation, and the cooperation of the other mentors.

Starred proposals are an alternate sorting mechanism to help the project
administrators.  So far, we're mostly using them to mark proposals where
we have a mentor preference when there were multiple proposals for a
project, and to mark projects that are 'complete' from an administrative
perspective.  I would expect the mentor community to see more starred
proposals as more reach a ready to be assigned status for us.

Thanks,

Brian

